{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 16:46:20.477766", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Health Assessment:\\nThe network is experiencing partial connectivity issues. While hosts connected to `leaf_1` are able to communicate with each other successfully, hosts connected to other leaf switches (`leaf_2`, `leaf_3`, and `leaf_4`) are unable to establish communication with hosts connected to `leaf_1`. This indicates a potential anomaly in the network\\'s routing or forwarding mechanisms.\\n\\n#### Observations:\\n1. **Successful Communication within `leaf_1`:**\\n   - Hosts `host_1_1`, `host_1_2`, `host_1_3`, and `host_1_4` are able to communicate with each other without any packet loss.\\n   - RTT (Round Trip Time) values are within acceptable ranges, though some variability is observed.\\n\\n2. **Failed Communication from Other Leaf Switches:**\\n   - Hosts connected to `leaf_2`, `leaf_3`, and `leaf_4` (e.g., `host_2_1`, `host_3_1`, `host_4_1`) are unable to communicate with hosts connected to `leaf_1`.\\n   - The ping results for these hosts show a status of \"unknown,\" indicating that no packets were transmitted or received.\\n\\n3. **Potential Root Cause:**\\n   - The issue may stem from a failure in the spine switches (`spine_1` and `spine_2`) or the SDN controller\\'s configuration. These components are responsible for interconnecting the leaf switches and ensuring proper routing between subnets.\\n\\n#### Next Steps:\\nFurther investigation is required to pinpoint the root cause of the anomaly. This includes:\\n- Verifying the configuration and operational status of the spine switches (`spine_1` and `spine_2`).\\n- Checking the SDN controller\\'s management and flow rules for the switches.\\n- Examining the network interfaces and routing tables of the affected leaf switches.\\n\\nThis report highlights the current state of the network and identifies areas requiring deeper analysis., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='6c04ff8f-1d9f-4aa5-a54a-a350e6476b8e'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
